      "title": "TCP: SEQ analysis precedence preference",
      "message": "TCP: SEQ analysis precedence preference\n\nIntroduce a new TCP preference to allow the user to choose the\nprecedence between Fast Retransmission or Out-Of-Order. When\nperforming the SEQ analysis, ambiguous packets will be considered\nwith the chosen priority, helping in the final interpretation.\nCloses #15987\n",
      "author_name": "Eugene Adell",
      "author_email": "eugene.adell@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2021-03-25T12:23:05.000+01:00",
      "committer_name": "Eugene Adell",
      "committer_email": "eugene.adell@gmail.com",
